      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Allows for DesignScript code to be authored directly",
      "Code": "// Outline of the 4: three overlapping closed rectangles, fused by Shape.Union below\n[[PolyCurve.ByPoints([Point.ByCoordinates(150, 30), Point.ByCoordinates(176, 30), Point.ByCoordinates(176, 178), Point.ByCoordinates(150, 178)], true)],\n [PolyCurve.ByPoints([Point.ByCoordinates(104, 80), Point.ByCoordinates(198, 80), Point.ByCoordinates(198, 106), Point.ByCoordinates(104, 106)], true)],\n [PolyCurve.ByPoints([Point.ByCoordinates(104, 80), Point.ByCoordinates(130, 80), Point.ByCoordinates(130, 170), Point.ByCoordinates(104, 170)], true)]];"
    },
